# ====================================================================
# Healthcare AI System - Frontend Configuration
# ====================================================================
# Follows Twelve-Factor App principles (Factor III: Config).
# Zero hardcoded hostnames or IPs exist in application code.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. API & WebSocket Endpoints
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web / PWA (Browser):
#   - Leave blank or omit in production; the app dynamically adapts
#     to window.location.origin (e.g. https://your-hospital.com/api/v1).
#   - For local Vite dev server, uncomment the localhost URLs below.
#
# Native Mobile (Capacitor Android / iOS):
#   - Android Emulator: defaults to http://10.0.2.2:8000/api/v1
#   - Physical Device on Local Wi-Fi: set to your PC's LAN IP
#     e.g., http://192.168.1.100:9000/api/v1 (or switch live via in-app Settings)
#   - Production Cloud App: set to your remote production API URL
#     e.g., https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
VITE_WS_BASE_URL=ws://localhost:8000/ws

# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Portal URLs (Optional - for cross-subdomain redirection)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used by src/utils/subdomain.ts to navigate between portals if using separate domains.
# If omitted, dynamic subdomains (partner.*, clinic.*) and ?portal=partner query
# parameters are handled automatically.
#
# VITE_PATIENT_URL=https://patient.yourdomain.com
# VITE_PARTNER_URL=https://partner.yourdomain.com
